data: {"query_job_id":1}

data: {"archive_id":"018e90e5-8b2a-4a61-a2fc-cac799936caf","timestamp":1633036800000,"message":"Example log message"}

event: end
data: {"status":"Succeeded","num_results_emitted":1,"num_duplicates_dropped":0,"num_protocol_errors":0}

parameters.description:
When `true`, results buffered in `MongoDB` are streamed sorted by timestamp descending;
otherwise, they're streamed in insertion order. Only applies to query jobs whose results
are buffered in `MongoDB`.
